edition 0
needs console and tasks

to delayed n d, needs tasks:
    sleep for d
    give back n

to producer ch, needs console and tasks:
    for each i in [1, 2, 3]:
        show "send {i}"
        send i into ch
    close ch

to main, needs console and tasks, may fail with not-found and several and timed-out:
    together:
        show "a"
        show "b"
    let xs be all of:
        delayed(20, 2s)
        delayed(10, 1s)
    show xs
    let r be all of:
        p: delayed(10, 1s)
        q: delayed(30, 3s)
    show r
    let w be first of:
        delayed(30, 3s)
        delayed(10, 1s)
    show w
    let ch be new-channel()
    together:
        producer(ch)
        for each x received from ch:
            show "got {x}"
    show (each n in [3, 1, 2] at the same time, n * 2)
    within 2 seconds:
        sleep for 5 seconds
        show "never"
